  "identityFinding": "The current OSM point and base1025 refer to the same named settlement Métouia/المطوية for manual display purposes. The point has17 consecutive named settlement versions, while the public municipal producer profile explicitly calls Métouia a town in Gabes. It is not a source record for El Metouia Nord or Sud.",
